    "style": "Voice: warm, clear, confident product host. Natural and human, never robotic. Tone: friendly and lightly playful, never salesy. American English. Pace: fast and energetic, like a 30-second product commercial, about 200 words per minute. Almost no pause between sentences. Read exactly the given text, with no added words. Nextshot is pronounced NEXT-shot.",
